{"id":"6afd5529-0690-83e8-aee7-a4d75e05600e","sections":[{"bodySize":767,"controls":{"checkbox":0,"fields":0,"radio":20,"reveal":0,"submit":5,"textarea":0},"count":5,"heading":"十一、本章綜合習題","html":"<p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\">以下題目結合多個觀念，難度略高於前面的理解檢查。建議先自行作答，再查看解析。</p>\n<div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 1 題</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">基本應用</p></div>25°C 時純水的飽和蒸氣壓為 23.8 mmHg。某密閉容器中有液態水及水蒸氣，且已達平衡。若在不改變溫度的情況下擴大容器體積，並確保最後仍有液態水，最終平衡蒸氣壓為何？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"0-_r_de_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"0\" id=\"0-_r_de_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. 小於 23.8 mmHg</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"1-_r_dg_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"1\" id=\"1-_r_dg_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. 等於 23.8 mmHg</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"2-_r_di_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"2\" id=\"2-_r_di_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 大於 23.8 mmHg</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"3-_r_dk_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"3\" id=\"3-_r_dk_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 無法判斷</label></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案與解析</span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 2 題</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">基本應用</p></div>某非揮發性、非電解質溶質與水形成遵守拉午耳定律的溶液。已知純水蒸氣壓為 30 mmHg，溶液蒸氣壓為 27 mmHg，且水有 9 mol。溶質有多少 mol？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"0-_r_do_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"0\" id=\"0-_r_do_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. 0.1 mol</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"1-_r_dq_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"1\" id=\"1-_r_dq_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. 0.5 mol</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"2-_r_ds_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"2\" id=\"2-_r_ds_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 1 mol</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"3-_r_du_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"3\" id=\"3-_r_du_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 3 mol</label></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案與解析</span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 3 題</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">綜合推理</p></div>理想溶液由 A、B 兩種揮發性液體組成。純 A、純 B 的蒸氣壓分別為 120、60 mmHg。若液相中 A 的莫耳分率為 0.25，則氣相中 A 的莫耳分率為何？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"0-_r_e2_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"0\" id=\"0-_r_e2_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. 0.25</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"1-_r_e4_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"1\" id=\"1-_r_e4_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. 0.40</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"2-_r_e6_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"2\" id=\"2-_r_e6_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 0.50</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"3-_r_e8_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"3\" id=\"3-_r_e8_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 0.75</label></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案與解析</span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-lg); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3);\"><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-align=\"center\" data-d-auto-spacing=\"\" data-d-component=\"row\" data-d-direction=\"row\" data-d-justify=\"between\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">第 4 題</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"xs\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-secondary);\">綜合推理</p></div>兩種液體混合後，實際總蒸氣壓高於同組成下的拉午耳定律預測值。下列何者最合理？<div role=\"radiogroup\" aria-required=\"false\" class=\"RadioGroup-tMSWPY RadioGroup-nex2Ya\" data-direction=\"col\" data-spacing=\"default\" aria-label=\"Options\" data-d-component=\"radio-group\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"outline: none;\"><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"0-_r_ec_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"0\" id=\"0-_r_ec_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>A. A–B 作用力相對較強</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"1-_r_ee_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"1\" id=\"1-_r_ee_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>B. A–B 作用力相對較弱</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"2-_r_eg_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"2\" id=\"2-_r_eg_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 混合後所有分子停止運動</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"3-_r_ei_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"3\" id=\"3-_r_ei_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 兩種液體必定具有相同蒸氣壓</label></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案與解析</span></button></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" data-d-has-border=\"\" style=\"border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radiu