tion-item=\"\"></button></div>B. 20°C 時水蒸氣分壓仍為 21.2 mmHg</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"2-_r_eq_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"2\" id=\"2-_r_eq_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>C. 部分水蒸氣凝結，最後相對濕度為 100%</label></div><div class=\"RadioLabelWrapper-jyx5cL\" data-d-component=\"radio\"><label for=\"3-_r_es_\" class=\"RadioLabel-aEyICO\" data-spacing=\"default\"><div class=\"RadioIndicatorWrapper-VjVXTu\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"3\" id=\"3-_r_es_\" class=\"RadioItem-eqbQKh\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"></button></div>D. 所有水蒸氣都凝結</label></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"Button-MckCnJ Button-MC8eGf\" data-color=\"primary\" data-variant=\"outline\" data-pill=\"\" data-size=\"lg\" data-block=\"\" disabled=\"\" aria-disabled=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-disabled=\"\" data-d-component=\"button\" data-d-block=\"\"><span class=\"ButtonInner-okLAMd\">檢查答案與解析</span></button></div></div>\n<div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div>","messageId":"c006c8dd-263e-4185-9aeb-b52a7361729f","numbered":["1","2","3","4","5"],"progress":[]}]}